the school only retains a shadow of its former glory, Hinata's conviction isn't shaken until he learns that Tobio Kageyama—the prodigy who humiliated Hinata's middle school volleyball team in a crushing defeat—is now his teammate.\n\nTo fulfill his desire of leaving a mark on the realm of volleyball—so often regarded as the domain of the tall and the strong—Hinata must smooth out his differences with Kageyama. Only when Hinata learns what it takes to be a part of a team will he be able to join the race to the top in earnest.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Volleyball","rank":99,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School Club","rank":93,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anti-Hero","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Fitness","rank":55,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":50,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"HAIKYU!!","english":"HAIKYU!!","native":"ハイキュー!!","romaji":"Haikyuu!!","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"排球少年"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"排球！！"}]},"trailer":{"id":"9kLRkH9zC5k","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9kLRkH9zC5k/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}